cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "open-matchday: free 2026/27 football results, fixtures and match statistics"
abstract: >-
  A daily-updated CSV dataset of 2026/27 football match results, upcoming
  fixtures, half-time scores, goal minutes and match statistics (shots, fouls,
  cards, corners) for 75 competitions across Europe and the world, compiled
  from free, keyless public sources.
authors:
  - name: "open-matchday contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/oladeeayo/open-matchday"
url: "https://github.com/oladeeayo/open-matchday"
keywords:
  - football
  - soccer
  - sports data
  - open data
  - dataset
  - CSV
  - match results
  - fixtures
  - football statistics
  - 2026/27 season
license: other
